    {
      "name": "Daily Split · next-day player retention",
      "description": "Recurring cohorts of browsers starting a daily sip. Day 1 shows who starts another daily sip on the next Phoenix calendar date. The latest cohort remains incomplete until that date ends. Uses reporting dates rather than visitor local challenge dates.",
      "tags": [
